  "problem_statement": "RIOT's phydat unit API must provide the unit identifiers UNIT_G_FORCE, UNIT_GRAM, and UNIT_GAUSS, and the phydat unit handling must treat them as gravitational force, gram, and Gauss respectively. In string and JSON output, UNIT_G_FORCE must be represented by the symbol \u201cg\u2099\u201d, UNIT_GRAM by \u201cg\u201d, and UNIT_GAUSS by \u201cGs\u201d. The units must also be recognized by the phydat-to-SenML conversion as the gravitational-force and Gauss units. Today the unit names and symbols are confusing or incorrect, so code expecting the new identifiers and symbols does not compile or produces the wrong output.",
